 476  60C7 CD A2 72         CALL MoveChain
 477  60CA C1               POP BC
 478  60CB 10 F9            DJNZ .ug_fast_advance
 479  60CD CD B3 6F         CALL AnimateChain
 480  60D0 CD 54 68         CALL TrySpawnAndCount
