1807  691E ED 79            OUT (C), A                            ; reg 0 = seconds
1808  6920 01 F7 BF         LD BC, #BFF7
1809  6923 ED 78            IN A, (C)                             ; A = BCD seconds
1810  6925 47               LD B, A
