2020  6A23                  ; VDC head-forward модель (Python-эквивалент):
2021  6A23                  ; 1. Compute new_offset = midpoint между head_neighbor и tail_neighbor.
2022  6A23                  ; 2. Shift Slots/SlotOffsets/Shot2 [idx..end] вправо на 1.
2023  6A23                  ; 3. Set Slots[idx]=color, SlotOffsets[idx]=new_offset, Shot2[idx]=1.
2024  6A23                  ; 4. SlotsLen += 1.
2025  6A23                  ; 5. HSA += 1 (с cap по track-end).
2026  6A23                  ; 6. SlotOffsets[0..idx-1] -= CELL_SIZE с cap'ом -CELL_SIZE (head компенсация).
2027  6A23                  ; 7. ChainFreezeCounter = CELL_SIZE.
2028  6A23
