4428  78CF                  ; --- Horizontal: X out of [0..DMA_X_MAX-1] → PRESERVE ---
4429  78CF 2A 6B 80         LD HL, (TmpChainX)
4430  78D2 CB 7C            BIT 7, H
4431  78D4 C2 A3 79         JP NZ, .bpc_preserve
4432  78D7 11 56 01         LD DE, DMA_X_MAX
